  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>As a Kalashtar, your trance allows you a more robust recovery and greater resistance to forced sleep. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to all saving throws against sleep effects and effects that cause or alter dreams. <br />In addition, sleep is more restorative for you. You regain <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">[[/r (@actor.level*2)*(max(@actor.abilities.con.mod,1))]]{HP equal to your Constitution modifier times double your level}</span><span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> instead of just times your level, and you reduce any </span>@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained} and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.3uh1r86TzbQvosxv]{Doomed}<span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\"> conditions you have by 2 instead of by 1. </span></p>"
    },
